---
import Layout from '@estate/ui/PortfolioLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
const p=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const endpoint=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LEAD_ENDPOINT || '';
const nav=[{label:'Why sell with us',href:'#why'},{label:'The process',href:'#process'},{label:'Marketing',href:'#marketing'},{label:'FAQs',href:'#faq'},{label:'Get a valuation',href:'#valuation'}];
---
<Layout title="FIELDNOTE Property | Get a Property Valuation — Demo" description="Fictional property-selling and valuation enquiry website with an interactive multi-step seller qualification form. No real valuation is generated." brand="FIELDNOTE / PROPERTY" nav={nav} accent="#244438">
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">SELLING WELL STARTS WITH CLARITY</p><h1>What could your<br>next move <em>look like?</em></h1><p>Whether you're thinking about selling now or simply exploring, start with a clear picture of your property and what matters to you.</p><a href="#valuation" class="primary">Get a property valuation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="muted-note">Demo process only. No actual valuation or agent callback is provided.</p></div><div class="hero-art"><img src={`${p}assets/fieldnote-residence.webp`} alt="Original AI-generated fictional landscaped home; not a property for sale" width="836" height="471" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="art-caption"><span>YOUR HOME, IN CONTEXT</span><span>FIELD STUDY / 01</span></div></div></div></section>
<div class="container value-strip"><div><strong>01</strong><span>Property first</span></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>Clear next steps</span></div><div><strong>03</strong><span>No-pressure enquiry</span></div></div>
<section id="why" class="container why-section"><div class="section-title"><p class="eyebrow">01 / WHY SELL WITH US</p><h2>Good decisions start with <em>good information.</em></h2></div><div class="why-grid"><div class="why-main"><p class="big-copy">Selling is more than setting a price. It's understanding the property, the market context, and the right next step for you.</p><p>FIELDNOTE is a fictional brokerage concept illustrating a transparent, seller-first journey, not a live brokerage service.</p></div><div class="why-list"><article><span>01</span><h3>Clarity over pressure</h3><p>Collect the right details before discussing options. No automated promise of what a home will sell for.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>A plan for the property</h3><p>Think through presentation, photos, pricing research and the details buyers need.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Communication matters</h3><p>Design a straightforward path from enquiry to human review — once a real operator is configured.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="valuation-section" id="valuation"><div class="container valuation-layout"><div class="valuation-intro"><p class="eyebrow">02 / YOUR PROPERTY</p><h2>Let's start with<br><em>the details.</em></h2><p>Answer a few questions to create a sample seller brief. Details are validated in your browser; they are not sent anywhere in this demo.</p><div class="privacy-panel"><strong>Before you begin</strong><p>This form does not calculate a market valuation. A genuine estimate would require verified comparables, property records and professional review.</p></div></div>
<form id="seller-valuation" class="valuation-form" data-capture-form data-endpoint={endpoint} method="post" action={`${p}api/lead`} data-seller-wizard><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></div><div class="wizard-top"><span data-step-text>01 / 03</span><span>YOUR SELLER BRIEF</span></div><div class="wizard-track"><span data-wizard-progress style="width:33.33%"></span></div>
<fieldset data-seller-step="0"><legend>Tell us about the home.</legend><p class="step-copy">Start with its basic characteristics.</p><div class="form-grid"><label>Property type *<select name="property_type" required><option value="">Choose type</option><option>Apartment</option><option>Villa</option><option>Townhouse</option><option>Penthouse</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Bedrooms *<select name="bedrooms" required><option value="">Choose bedrooms</option>{['Studio','1','2','3','4','5','6+'].map(v=><option>{v}</option>)}</select></label><label class="wide">Area / building *<input type="text" name="area_building" minlength="2" maxlength="120" required placeholder="Community, area, or building"/></label><label>Size (sq ft) *<input type="number" name="size_sqft" min="100" max="1000000" required placeholder="e.g. 1850" /></label><label>Property condition<select name="condition"><option value="">Select (optional)</option><option>Original condition</option><option>Well maintained</option><option>Recently renovated</option><option>New / never occupied</option></select></label></div></fieldset>
<fieldset data-seller-step="1" hidden><legend>What is your selling plan?</legend><p class="step-copy">Help define timing and readiness. No price prediction is calculated here.</p><div class="form-grid"><label>Occupancy *<select name="occupancy" required><option value="">Select occupancy</option><option>Vacant</option><option>Owner occupied</option><option>Tenanted</option></select></label><label>Estimated value (AED) *<select name="estimated_value" required><option value="">Select a range</option><option value="under-1m">Under AED 1M</option><option value="1-2m">AED 1M–2M</option><option value="2-5m">AED 2M–5M</option><option value="5-10m">AED 5M–10M</option><option value="10m-plus">Above AED 10M</option><option value="unsure">Not sure</option></select></label><label class="wide">Selling timeline *<select name="timeline" required><option value="">Select timeline</option><option>Immediately</option><option>Within 3 months</option><option>Within 6 months</option><option>6–12 months</option><option>Just exploring</option></select></label><label class="wide">Additional context<textarea name="notes" rows="3" maxlength="600" placeholder="Upgrades, tenancy, or anything useful (optional)"></textarea></label></div></fieldset>
<fieldset data-seller-step="2" hidden><legend>Your property brief is ready.</legend><p class="step-copy">Add contact details to demonstrate a future valuation enquiry submission.</p><div class="form-grid"><label>Full name *<input type="text" name="name" minlength="2" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="Your name"/></label><label>Email *<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" /></label><label class="wide">Phone (optional)<input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+971 50 000 0000" /></label><label class="consent wide"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required/><span>I consent to being contacted if a real operator is configured. <a href={`${p}privacy/`}>Privacy notice</a>.</span></label></div></fieldset>
<div class="wizard-error" data-wizard-error role="alert" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="wizard-actions"><button type="button" class="back" data-wizard-back hidden>← Back</button><button type="button" class="next" data-wizard-next>Continue <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><button type="submit" class="next" data-wizard-submit hidden>Request valuation review ↗</button></div><p data-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="fine-print">Demo only. No calculation, lead storage, brokerage appointment or promised response.</p>
</form></div></section>
<section class="container process-section" id="process"><div class="section-title"><p class="eyebrow">03 / HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>A thoughtful process,<br>from first conversation.</h2></div><div class="process-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Tell us about the home</h3><p>Property type, size, occupancy and the features that distinguish it.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Understand the local market</h3><p>A real adviser would verify comparable transactions, active competition and demand.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Make a tailored plan</h3><p>Agree on presentation, price strategy, marketing and a realistic timeline.</p></article></div></section>
<section id="marketing" class="marketing-section"><div class="container marketing-layout"><img src={`${p}assets/marketing-study.webp`} alt="Original AI-generated interior staging concept, showing how property photography could look" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / THE MARKETING PLAN</p><h2>Present the property<br><em>with intention.</em></h2><p>A strong marketing programme starts with accurate information and compelling presentation.</p><ul><li>Professional images and a useful floor plan</li><li>Clear specifications and honest property copy</li><li>Distribution appropriate to the property and buyer profile</li><li>Response handling, viewing coordination and feedback</li></ul><p class="fine-print">These are proposed steps, not claims about results or services already delivered.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="container insights-section"><div class="section-title"><p class="eyebrow">05 / MARKET CONTEXT</p><h2>More than a headline price.</h2></div><div class="insight-grid"><article><span>CONSIDER / 01</span><h3>Comparable properties</h3><p>Review similar homes by building, location, size, condition, view and transaction date.</p></article><article><span>CONSIDER / 02</span><h3>Current competition</h3><p>Active asking prices are useful signals, but they are not evidence of completed sale values.</p></article><article><span>CONSIDER / 03</span><h3>Cost of selling</h3><p>Include applicable fees, settlement arrangements and any mortgage or tenancy obligations.</p></article></div><p class="fine-print">Educational example insights; not actual market data or pricing advice.</p></section>
<section id="faq" class="faq-section"><div class="container faq-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">06 / QUESTIONS</p><h2>Before the next step.</h2></div><div class="faq-items"><details><summary>Will I receive an instant valuation?<span>+</span></summary><p>No. This is a demonstration of the information collection experience, not a valuation engine. Real estimates require verified local data and a professional review.</p></details><details><summary>Does the website send my details to an agent?<span>+</span></summary><p>Not by default. No real brokerage or CRM endpoint is configured in this public demonstration.</p></details><details><summary>How should I choose a sale price?<span>+</span></summary><p>Compare verified recent transactions, active competition and property-specific features with a qualified local professional.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change my selling timeline?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. The sample process allows you to choose whether you are ready now or still exploring.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="bottom-cta container"><h2>Start with the details.<br><em>The rest can follow.</em></h2><a class="primary" href="#valuation">Get a property valuation ↗</a></section>
</Layout>
<script>import '../scripts/seller.ts';</script>
